[[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the bonnet lid.</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the electronic control\nunit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Engine management ECU</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890773\">M10B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections (2a, 2b, 2c, 2d, 2f, 2g,\n2h, 2i, 2j, 2k, 2l, 2m).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Front/engine junction</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890015\">D4</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Idle actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890975\">N74</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2c</p></td><td><p>Throttle position sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890669\">K56</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2d</p></td><td><p>Integrated air temperature sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890638\">K43</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2e</p></td><td><p>Speedometer sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890716\">K84</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2f</p></td><td><p>Engine coolant temperature sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890643\">K45</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2g</p></td><td><p>Ignition coil</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889731\">A30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2h</p></td><td><p>Injector junction</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890228\">D81</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2i</p></td><td><p>Alternator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889722\">A10B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2l</p></td><td><p>RPM sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890647\">K46</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2m</p></td><td><p>Starter motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889728\">A20B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2n</p></td><td><p>Brake fluid level sensor (switch)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890615\">K30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2o</p></td><td><p>Detonation sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890658\">K50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Open the rigid outer casing protecting the wiring.</p><p>4. Disconnect the wiring retaining bands.</p><p>5. Remove the wiring.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035373.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<p>If necessary, removing the wiring connecting\nthe injectors:</p><p><strong>- 1072A10 inlet and exhaust manifold - r + r and replace seals</strong></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections for the injectors.</p><p>2. Disconnect the retaining bands.</p><p>3. Remove the wiring.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035374.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the wiring is not damaged and,\nif necessary, check the electrical continuity.</p><p>If removed, position the injector connecting\nwiring, connect the electrical connections and fix the wiring with\nthe retaining bands.</p><p><strong>- 1072A10 inlet and exhaust manifold - r + r and replace seals</strong></p><p>Place the electronic ignition wiring in\nposition.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections.</p><p>Close the rigid protective outer casing.</p><p>Connect the wiring retaining bands.</p><p>Check the operation of the system using\nthe Examiner or the other diagnostic equipment.</p>"]]